url: "https://github.com/FaizPalwala/virtual-id-gen"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FaizPalwala/virtual-id-gen"
abstract: >
  A family of synthetic, identity-conditioned face datasets generated via
  InstantID + Juggernaut-XL-v9 from CC0 synthetic SFHQ seed images.  600
  synthetic identities with MUFAC-aligned split isolation (identity-level
  retain 540 / forget 60; per-image train + holdout subsets) and a
  sequential 15-step forgetting protocol.  Three artifacts across two
  releases: SFHQ-VirtualID-Bench (224x224 aligned crops — 45,000 balanced
  + 27,593 imbalanced with a ratio-based 70:40:20 train gradient) and
  SFHQ-VirtualID-Raw (1024x1024 portraits, 51,000 images, max-size).
keywords:
